ain they had very little success with  it but one young entrepreneur named walt  disney decided to buy eight of them for  a movie he was making called fantasia  and their tool was used to help make the  movie  and they were excited that somebody had  used it somebody had bought so many of  them and they thought you know maybe  this product can work but we need to  adapt how we're selling it and so they  said let's try doing direct mail  marketing and they wrote out a few  letters to people saying you know  promoting their product and how great it  was and some orders started to trickle  in so they started to do more and more  and more orders came in and that was the  growth of hewlett-packard and so the  first product didn't work out but they  adapted the first marketing strategy  they used didn't work and so they  adapted and hewlett pack continued to  adapt over the years and they're a  company known for innovation and  adaptation and they launched tons of new  products they not only created new  product lines but also adapted the way  business was done they were one of the  first companies to introduce flex hours  and  profit sharing for employees they  created a culture called the hp way at a  time when there wasn't corporate culture  their their one car backyard garage is  now considered the birthplace of silicon  valley and is a museum that you can go  and see and so  all along the way  they continue to adapt to improve their  business and that's what you need to do  because it's very rare that your first  idea is going to work that your first  marketing strategy is going to work that  your first employee that you hire is  going to work it almost doesn't work out  and that's okay and that's normal and  that happens to everybody the key to the  winners the ones that make it the  entrepreneurs who make it through and  achieve their goals are the ones who  continue to adapt to change to make it  better to take the feedback that they're  getting and find another way to stand so  adapt  and believe  for those of you watching like the video  you can subscribe to the channel to see  more videos just like this thank you so  much for watching i'll see you soon
 

